    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giu has been tasked with returning the holy artifact to it's pedestal at the top of the world. If he fails, he will be devoured by his brethren.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get It Up! is a punishing balancing game, a homage to games like Getting Over It, Jump King, and Pogostuck. Much like those games, this game is a test of patience and perseverance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple: Go UP while balancing THE STICK, navigating and overcoming traps and tricky terrain. Don't drop THE STICK, or yourself. One false move, and it's back to the start, again and again. Experience new levels of frustration you probably didn't know you were capable of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reward for reaching the top is incredible self-satisfaction, knowing you can do what you set your mind to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly 2 to \u221e hours of torturous gameplay. Good luck.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giu has been tasked with returning the holy artifact to it's pedestal at the top of the world. If he fails, he will be devoured by his brethren.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get It Up! is a punishing balancing game, a homage to games like Getting Over It, Jump King, and Pogostuck. Much like those games, this game is a test of patience and perseverance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple: Go UP while balancing THE STICK, navigating and overcoming traps and tricky terrain. Don't drop THE STICK, or yourself. One false move, and it's back to the start, again and again. Experience new levels of frustration you probably didn't know you were capable of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reward for reaching the top is incredible self-satisfaction, knowing you can do what you set your mind to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly 2 to \u221e hours of torturous gameplay. Good luck.</p>",
    "short_description": "Can you make it to the top while balancing the stick on your head?\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164...probably not. It's pretty hard.",
